menu "MCP2518FD driver"

    config MCP251XFD_PERF_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Enable CAN throughput diagnostics"
        default n
        help
            Log MCP service windows and delayed consumption of WiCAN's shared
            RX queue. Includes per-frame counters and queue timestamps.
            Leave disabled for normal use to compile out this instrumentation.
            Queue-drop and controller-fault warnings remain available.

endmenu
